flowchart TB
  AD[Doctor-in-Charge] --> Oversight[Oversee all queues]
  AD --> Staff[Manage staff and audit]
  AD --> Correct[Reassign, correct and archive]
  DC[Doctor] --> Consult[Confirm and start consultation]
  DC --> Clinical[Document diagnosis and prescription]
  DC --> Complete[Complete care or request follow-up]
  NS[Nurse] --> Review[Review submitted intake]
  NS --> Schedule[Assign doctor and schedule]
  RC[Receptionist] --> Register[Find or register student]
  RC --> Intake[Create and submit intake]
  PT[Student] --> Journey[View own care journey]
  PT --> Approved[View approved summary and prescription]
